1.0.10-snapshot
  Summary: performance and infrastructure

  Performance and Infrastructure
    - Rebuilt the validator into layered rules for crashes, unsafe engine usage, performance, best practices, smoke load, and secret leaks.
    - The validator runs on every change, locally and in CI, and a grade gate fails the build on any finding.
    - Profiled and tuned with JitProfiler, an engine-native, scientific profiler.
    - Consolidated the whole engine layer into xlibs and standardized naming and structure across every mod.

1.0.9
  Renamed: now DiegeticControl, part of the Diegetic audio family.
  Fixed: radio and megaphone volume holds steady at the set level, and returning a frequency slider to default restores the original timing.
  Fixed: MCM volume-slider and toggle labels now display in both English and Russian.
  Compatibility:
    Requires xlibs 1.8.4 and themrdemonized modded exes 20250908+ or AOEngine v0.55+.
    Added: platform status in the MCM footer and boot log, matching the Alife family, showing the exact engine build and whether it is fully or partially compatible.

1.0.8
  Compatibility:
    Removed: modded exes requirement. Works with vanilla Anomaly 1.5.3, Demonized, Demonized MT, AOEngine. Tested with GAMMA, EFP, Zona.

1.0.7
  Changed: xlibs 1.2.5 dependency.

1.0.6
  Added: timed event scheduling works correctly with major modpacks (globals resolve at call time for demonized_time_events compatibility)
  Added: version displayed at startup (mod + xlibs)
  Changed: MCM visual refresh
  Fixed: dep gate version check uses correct xlibs API
  Fixed: Russian MCM encoding restored (windows-1251)

1.0.5
  xlibs 1.2.3 dependency.

1.0.4
  Changed: xlibs dependency updated to 1.2.1

1.0.3
  MCM snapshot pattern and performance improvements.
  Changed: MCM configuration uses snapshot pattern (xmcm.create_config) for faster reads
  Changed: MCM reset button support (mcm_option_restore_default callback)
  Fixed: uncached engine globals (CreateTimeEvent, RegisterScriptCallback)
  Changed: xlibs dependency updated to 1.2.0

1.0.2
  Fixed: dependency gate uses exact version match instead of string comparison

1.0.1
  Dependency gate and Russian translation.
  Added: dependency gate - clear error message if xlibs is missing or outdated
  Added: Russian translation

1.0.0
  First release. Volume and pause control for radios, megaphones, guitar, harmonica.
  Added: per-source volume sliders with master multiplier
  Added: pause/frequency control for radios and megaphones
  Added: per-source enable/disable toggles
  Added: graceful handling of missing audio mods
